WEBVTT

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.820
Hasekura... kun...

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:29.210
That Erika... I never considered she'd actually return without taking a Dependent.

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.760
To what extent must she defy her mother?

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:36.090
That failure.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.520
Red Promise

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.440
Yay! It's sunny out!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.290
Good morning!

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.330
G-Good morning.

00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:14.220
She's not here again?

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:19.100
I thought I'd see her today.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.350
Didn't she have something she wanted from me?

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.890
Why do you ask?

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:27.810
Because when I woke up, I found this outside of my room.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:33.730
Hasekura-senpai... You see, the truth is-

00:01:33.730 --> 00:01:34.530
Shiro!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.110
B-But...

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:40.780
Oh yeah. By the way, about this proposal.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:42.790
I think it's pretty good.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.870
Could you go ahead with what you have down?

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:47.000
Regarding the after party?

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.790
What did Vice Prez say about it?

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.000
You don't have to worry about Erika.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.800
She's no longer here.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:55.300
No longer here?

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.930
W-Wait a minute!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.720
What do you mean by that?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:04.220
I-I'm sorry. I'm all my fault.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.810
It's because I said unnecessary things.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.350
Stop it, Shiro!

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:14.780
Because I said I would become her Dependent, she...

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:16.490
Erika-senpai...

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.780
Dependent? Shiro-chan?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:24.450
Could you come with me for a second, Hasekura-kun?

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.910
Vice Prez returned to her home?

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:31.580
Why?! Why so suddenly?

00:02:31.580 --> 00:02:35.550
Accept it. It's the choice she made on her own.

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:36.590
We can't do anything about it.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.130
"On her own"?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.760
I can't believe that!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.680
Her wish was to live as a human at this school.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:49.560
That's why she wasn't going to drink blood from people or take Dependents.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.360
She was going to find a way before graduation.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.900
Not drink blood, huh?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:03:01.490
But that day with the fireworks,
you offered your blood to Erika, right?

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.990
I...

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:06.700
I had no choice at that time, and you said-

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:10.250
Yes, I did ask you to support Erika.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:18.420
But once we drink blood directly from a human,
we face strong urges to have more.

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:23.970
Once that happens, transfusion blood won't have any effect.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:30.020
I can't imagine the thirst she fought and suffered through.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.230
But the Vice Prez said she's fine now...

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.980
She probably didn't want to make you worry.

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.860
You can be pretty dense, can't you?

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.700
Vice Prez...

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:55.210
Shiro-chan couldn't bear the situation anymore and said she'd become her Dependent, but Erika refused.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:04:00.010
At this rate, she'll succumb to her instinct to seek blood.

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.090
She couldn't take Shiro-chan's future away, too.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.340
That's why Erika made the agonizing decision.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.100
There's still time, Hasekura-kun.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:16.690
I think there is only one way for Erika to return to school.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:20.150
Give it some thought.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:23.110
I'll await your wise decision.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:40.340
The Vice Prez, who enjoyed school life so much, is...

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:44.380
She was look forward to the Culture Festival, and...

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.930
Can you finish this up?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.190
It's because of me.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:05:00.400
Yet, I didn't even realize the suffering she was facing...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.200
I...

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.460
I will never drink blood from a human.

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.210
I will not take a Dependent either.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.880
Even if that is un-vampiric.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:22.800
Because I...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.140
What am I supposed to do?

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:45.190
Festival

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:45.190
Culture

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.910
Theater Club
presentation

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:55.080
Boss!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.370
I want you to take a quick look.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:58.870
What do you think?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.930
We want the Vice President to see it.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.680
It's working out better than we'd imagined, so I think even she'd be surprised.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.850
Do you think she can make time to come down?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:16.680
I'll ask her.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:18.890
Thank you very much!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.480
All right! Let's keep it going!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.690
Yeah!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.780
The other day, Vice Prez was...

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.740
You know, Erika-senpai was...

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:34.540
Working hard, Boss?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.870
You can't be wasting time here.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.210
Vice Prez!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.710
Haruna...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.010
You dare mistake my Hina-chan for Eririn?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.010
This isn't a good sign.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.720
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:56.350
N-No, it's all right. Everyone makes mistakes.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:00.770
Especially when your mind is completely preoccupied with the Culture Festival.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:01.600
Right?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.810
Y-Yeah...

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.490
Did something happen, Kouhei-kun?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:11.950
Kouhei...

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.910
I see, I see. It's hard to talk about it, huh?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.620
Then we'll listen to you tonight in your room.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:18.950
Tonight?!

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.710
Yup. How about a tea party once in a while?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.420
You need breathers here and there.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.130
That's a good idea.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.340
Let's invite Sendo-san, as well.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.960
Vice Prez?

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.590
We haven't had the chance to relax and chat with Sendo-san in a while.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:34.550
You're right.

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:41.560
You get to see her in the Directing Student's Room, but I want to hear what she thinks of the after party idea I came up with.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.230
It's not necessarily your idea.

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:46.520
I gave him the original idea.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:48.070
So yeah, Kouhei?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.780
Y-Yeah.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.280
Thanks, Kouhei.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.450
We'll see you later.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:03.120
Everything's ready!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.460
The best tea leafs, check!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:07.340
Snacks, check!

00:08:07.340 --> 00:08:10.880
All we're waiting for is Kouhei-kun to bring Sendo-san.

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:14.760
I can't wait!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:24.140
I see. So Eririn was busy.

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.520
I'm sorry.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.480
It's not something you need to apologize for.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:31.150
That's right. If today didn't work, there's still tomorrow.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.490
It's not like that!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.410
What is it like then?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.330
Vice Prez won't make it tomorrow, either.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.000
Day after tomorrow, either.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.460
At this rate, never.

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.710
Never?

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:51.630
Starting next semester, the President is saying he'll consider her as having transferred.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.170
"Consider her as"?

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.970
What does that mean?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:56.260
It's...

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.800
I'm sorry! It's all my fault!

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.350
Because of me, Vice Prez has...

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.190
I was wondering what you were going to say with such a serious look on your face.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.860
You've got really bad taste, Kouhei.

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:12.650
She's right; there's no way Sendo-san would go somewhere, leaving the Culture Festival behind.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:21.540
Yup. She loves this school more than anyone and works tirelessly if it's for students to have a fun school life.

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.370
That's the Sendo-san we know.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.710
I can't imagine a Culture Festival without her.

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:29.670
Tsukasa...

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:31.800
Haruna...

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.510
Kanade-san...

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:39.850
Hey! Was that an excuse for not being able to bring Eririn over?

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:40.890
Or was it a practical joke?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.890
If you want to surprise us,
you'd better come up with a better lie.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.190
Lie...

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:47.940
But...

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:49.980
Kouhei-kun.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:54.150
If what you said is true,

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.700
are you all right with the way things are?

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.120
I wouldn't be.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:07.210
I don't like seeing you frown because of it,
nor do I enjoy not being able to see Sendo-san.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:12.250
If Eririn's gone somewhere, then all you have to do is bring her back.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:16.010
You said something about it being your fault.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.760
If so, it's a man's duty to take responsibility, isn't it?

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:23.890
Tsukasa...

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:29.060
Thank you, everyone.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.060
Kouhei?

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.060
Kouhei-kun?

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.820
I promise to bring the Vice Prez to the next tea party.

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:43.990
That's right. There's no point just thinking about it.

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:47.870
No matter what anyone says, this school needs her.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.580
Thank you very much.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:55.880
Aren't you in luck, Yukimaru?

00:10:58.420 --> 00:10:59.680
Yukimaru?

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.810
Hasekura-senpai...

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:12.440
Not a single person can be missing from our school life.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.320
Where are you off to in such a rush?

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.320
Really now... You don't even know where to go.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.030
Prez.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:26.120
Follow me. I'll escort you there.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.400
What?!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.110
Why?

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.830
Sendo Erika. Kaya wants you.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.360
So you are Hasekura Kouhei?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.370
I heard the tale from Iori.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.580
So you wish to see me, I heard.

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.210
What brings you here?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.840
I'll listen if it's something I wish to hear.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.920
Come closer.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:06.010
Go on, Hasekura-kun.

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.750
The reason I'm here today is in regards to the Vice President,

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:44.090
Erika-san.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.300
Erika, eh?

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.390
How wise of you.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.470
You've come to become her Dependent willingly, eh?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:54.890
No, I will not become a Dependent.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:56.100
What?

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:58.520
Hasekura?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.520
I'm here to take the Vice President back.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.820
Take her back?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.200
For what reason?

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:10.070
We need her with us.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.580
Not just us.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:16.200
What she needs most is the
school life she spends with everyone.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.870
What good is that?

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.960
What Erika needs is a Dependent.

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.250
She wants to live as a human.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.970
To do so, she needs her school life.

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.590
Don't speak as though you know everything!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.020
What could a human possibly understand?

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:48.950
We've been disparaged for nothing more than drinking blood, which is equivalent to rice for you.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:58.710
For us to live at ease, we need a stable source of blood.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.670
Companions to live our eternal lives with.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.830
Dependents!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:07.960
What the Vice President needs isn't anything like that...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.470
What she wishes for are...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:14.890
...friends who understand her...

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.770
He's putting up a better fight than I'd thought he would.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:24.230
You're doing it again! You brought Hasekura here knowing this would happen, didn't you?!

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.610
Remember what I said? I have high hopes for him.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.740
"Hopes"?

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:34.030
Oh, don't get me wrong. My position is neutral.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:39.830
But I'm interested in seeing what lies as a result of Erika's wishes.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:43.830
I want to know if my cute sister can find her new path in life.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.540
There is no new path in life.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.090
After all, this boy is dying here, right now!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.340
Die!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.220
Stop it, Mother!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:57.760
Erika.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:03.350
So you've come.

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.070
Hasekura-kun... Why?

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:15.410
Vice Prez... I finally got to see you.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.870
Erika! This is your last chance.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.630
Make that boy your Dependent right here as I watch.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.550
What?

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:32.050
I can't... do that.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.390
If you can't, then I'll be forced to kill him.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.850
I won't let you do that.

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:39.560
What?

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:43.480
I won't take him as my Dependent.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:48.190
Hasekura-kun. This isn't a place for you.

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:50.480
Please, leave!

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:53.240
How do you expect me to go back alone?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.160
You have to come with me.

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:57.870
Don't you get it?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.410
It's the only way for you to survive!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:05.370
Vice Prez... You're the one who doesn't get it.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.090
Has something changed after leaving the school?

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:14.630
Is it easier for you now that you've returned to your home all alone?

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.720
Well...

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:33.030
If the suffering is the same, be at the academy you love!

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.400
Don't keep it to yourself; share it with us.

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:40.780
B-But if I can't hold myself back...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.450
You can drink my blood.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:51.340
To be honest, I don't think I can understand the suffering you're going through.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.300
But...

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.090
But?

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:59.550
I can ease your suffering a little for you.

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:10.980
If Erika takes another sip of your blood, there's no turning back for her.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.570
There will be no choice but for you to become her Dependent.

00:18:15.690 --> 00:18:16.990
I may become one.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.030
Or I may not.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:21.490
But...

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:24.830
It's for us to decide!

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:31.590
Kuchiduketa akai yakusoku

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:31.590
The red promise sealed with a kiss.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:38.090
Tsumasaki de kimi dake ni ageruyo

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:38.090
On my toes, I'll only give it to you.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:37.220
You don't want to lose any more bonds, right?

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.930
You're the one who said we need to hold hands at times like this.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:44.850
Mabushii hikari nara ima wa iranaiwa

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:44.850
I don't need the bright light now

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.720
Hasekura-kun...

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.980
Futari ga isshoni ireba

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.980
If we can be together.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.140
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:51.230
Let's go back to Shuchikan Academy.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:11.960
Nurui nemuri zutto matteta

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:11.960
I've been waiting for this warm, soothing sleep.

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:18.510
Me wo samashinasai kodou yuruyakani

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:18.510
Open your eyes to a steady heartbeat.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:25.180
Inori wo sotto rizumu ni awaseta

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:25.180
I've synchronized my prayer to its rhythm.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:26.600
This is what you were hoping for from Hasekura?

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:32.850
Kako ha atarashii kyou no tame no kiseki

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:32.850
The past is a guide to the arising today.

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.180
I'm not sure.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.600
Their relationship is still developing.

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:39.400
Nukumori ga netsu wo obiteku

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:39.400
The warmth is starting to build up.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.940
It's fine.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:41.740
So long as she is with him, it is clear she will eventually crave his blood.

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:45.950
Watashi kara yubisaki wo kasaneta

00:19:39.400 --> 00:19:45.950
I took the initiative and laid my fingers on yours.

