Aimai na ima wo kake nuke

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:05.930
We dash through the uncertain days together

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:09.600
To vampires, Dependents are companions that live eternity with them.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:12.690
Kimi to iru eien wo ikiruno

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:12.690
To live this eternity together.

