Itoshii kimochi hora

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:15.520
Do you feel this love?

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.110
You need not speak any more than is required!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.150
Zenbu misetakute

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:19.150
I want to show it all to you.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.730
