00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.480
It is.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:25.700
Tomadou kuchibiru fureta

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:25.700
I daintily place my lips over yours

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:21.860
Understood.

