00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:48.090
Write down the hope with no name on the hero's map

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:56.270
Hora kamisama ga kimeta shinario ha hakushi to wakarudesho?

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:56.270
Then see, can you tell the scenario written by God is actually blank?

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:00.770
Negaigoto moshimo hitotsu

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:00.770
If one wish can come true,

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:04.320
Kanau to shita nara mou mayowanai

00:23:00.770 --> 00:23:04.320
Then I will not be lost again.

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:08.240
Anbaransu demo bukiyoudatte

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:08.240
That it is off-balance or even if I'm clumsy,

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:11.780
Tsubasa wo hiroge kaze ni naru

00:23:08.240 --> 00:23:11.780
I will spread my wings and become the wind!

