Kioku no hi wo tayasanaide

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:22.830
Don't let the flame of memory die,

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:26.750
Kako mo mirai mo genzai mo

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:26.750
In the past, future, or present.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:30.260
Mou ichido ato mou ichido

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:30.260
Once more. Just once more.

