00:23:49.030 --> 00:23:50.950
I don't mind being the way I am now.

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:50.280
That's our promise.

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:56.620
kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:56.620
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.490
What's important is what we do from here on.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:58.950
Deaiwo...

